       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DISCOUNT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 GROSS-CENTS PIC 9(9) COMP-3.
       01 CLASS-CODE PIC X.
       01 NET-CENTS PIC 9(9) COMP-3.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF CLASS-CODE = 'P' AND GROSS-CENTS >= 100000
               COMPUTE NET-CENTS = GROSS-CENTS - (GROSS-CENTS / 10)
           ELSE
               MOVE GROSS-CENTS TO NET-CENTS
           END-IF.
           GOBACK.
